<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1842962105"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1566499236"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="透明な君"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="nayuta"/><amll:meta key="album" value="透明な君を掬う"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="05:26.911"><div begin="00:08.461" end="05:02.206"><p begin="00:08.461" end="00:26.293" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">目を閉じて明日を静かに待った<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">闭上双眼</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">me wo to ji te</span></p><p begin="00:28.816" end="00:40.634" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">けれどその日は来なかった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">然而那一天终究没有到来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ke re do so no hi ha ko na ka 't ta</span></p><p begin="00:43.162" end="00:59.269" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">ただずっと夜が続いた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">唯有永夜在无尽延续</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta da zu 't to yo ru ga tsu du i ta</span></p><p begin="01:18.983" end="01:32.190" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">心音も身体の温度も奪い続けていく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">连心跳与体温都被持续夺走</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi n o n mo ka ra da no o n do mo u ba i tsu du ke te ku</span></p><p begin="01:33.143" end="01:46.449" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">瞼の裏に焼け 蘇る記憶<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">烙印在眼睑深处的记忆复苏</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma bu ta no u ra ni ya ke yo mi ga e ru ki o ku</span></p><p begin="01:46.955" end="02:01.612" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">ここで私は確かに生きていたの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我确实曾在这里真实地存在过</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ko de wa ta shi ha ta shi ka ni i ki te i ta no</span></p><p begin="02:13.818" end="02:21.311" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">遠くなる灯火たち<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">逐渐远去的灯火</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to o ku na ru to mo shi bi ta chi</span></p><p begin="02:21.980" end="02:28.938" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">消えていく祈りの光は<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki e te yu ku i no ri no hi ka ri ha</span></p><p begin="02:29.975" end="02:35.393" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">未来を照らすことを<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi ra i wo te ra su ko to wo</span></p><p begin="02:36.848" end="02:43.956" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">許されなかった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">照亮未来的道路</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu ru sa re na ka 't ta</span></p><p begin="03:12.184" end="03:21.080" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">閉ざされた箱庭の中で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在被封锁的箱庭之中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to za sa re ta ha ko ni wa no na ka de</span></p><p begin="03:21.765" end="03:24.526" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">どこへも行けずに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">连逃离都无能为力</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do ko he mo i ke zu ni</span></p><p begin="03:26.004" end="03:39.530" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">諦めることさえ 容易くはなくて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">甚至连放弃的念头都难以浮现</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ki ra me ru ko to sa e ta ya su ku ha na ku te</span></p><p begin="03:39.716" end="03:54.045" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">神様なんていないと分かったんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">终于明白神明根本不存在</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka mi sa ma na n te i na i to wa ka 't ta n da</span></p><p begin="03:55.385" end="04:08.226" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">時計の針は 零時を指していた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">时钟的指针刺向了零点</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to ke i no ha ri ha re i ji wo sa shi te i ta</span></p><p begin="04:08.303" end="04:22.255" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">君に私はもう見えないんだよね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的身影已无法映入你的眼眸</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi ni wa ta shi ha mo u mi e na i n da yo ne</span></p><p begin="04:26.187" end="04:31.388" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">空へ駆ける君を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">追逐着向天空疾驰的你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so ra he ka ke ru ki mi wo o i ka ke ta</span></p><p begin="04:32.257" end="04:39.600" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">追いかけた何度も何度も</p><p begin="04:40.419" end="04:46.137" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">ふたりで探しにいく</p><p begin="04:47.274" end="04:58.242" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">この終わりの歌-始まりの歌-<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这首终结之歌（这首起始之歌）</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no o wa ri no u ta ( ko no ha ji ma ri no u ta</span></p><p begin="04:59.095" end="05:02.206" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">さあ行こう<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa a yu ko u</span></p></div></body></tt>